main.c: the browser runs the main loop.

AgbMain initializes and returns; AgbMainFrame is one iteration of the loop,
run by the platform (PlatformFrame). WaitForVBlank names the flag it waits
for instead of spinning; the platform lets time pass until the VBlank
interrupt handler sets it.

